__pycache__/
*.pyc
logs/
.claude/worktrees/
resources/weights/*.pt
resources/weights/*.xml
resources/weights/*.bin
!resources/weights/.gitkeep
# Enrolled guard templates and the crops they came from are personal data and
# runtime state — they belong in the mounted resources/ volume, never in git.
# The README stays tracked so the expected layout ships with the repo.
resources/gallery/*
!resources/gallery/README.md
